  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection Assistance for Vulnerable Communities and Migrants at Risk of Human Trafficking in Venezuela</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project has been developed to support the 2022-2023 Venezuela&#x2019;s Humanitarian Response Plan and has as its overall objective to improve the response to victims of trafficking (VoT) in Amazonas, Apure and Sucre. The proposed intervention will focus on: i) enhancing the capacity of key local actors on human trafficking prevention, detection and assistance to VoT</narrative>
  </description>
